TRANSLATION
All the sons of Dhåtaräñöra along with their allied kings, and Bhéñma, Droëa 
and Karëa, and all our soldiers are rushing into Your mouths, their heads 
smashed by Your fearful teeth. I see that some are being crushed between Your 
teeth as well.

